        "text": "Gardenia retrenches staff. OpenAI invests S$300M to hire AI engineers in Singapore. Statistically, are more jobs being created in Singapore than lost? Probably. But let’s look at the reality on the ground. If you’re an IT engineer displaced from Gardenia, you’re likely asking: “Can I realistically get hired by OpenAI?” The uncomfortable truth: Upskilling matters, but the jobs being created and the jobs being lost exist in two totally different universes."
      }
