      "text": "Jenya Bogacheva Loved this reflection! The shift from ML Engineer to AI Engineer feels very real, especially with agentic workflows becoming more practical and production-focused. “Agent harness” is such a useful way to think about what actually makes agents work beyond the model itself.",
      "parentActivityId": "7463278802236911616",
